"The graphics card is set up when the next photo is made." = "The graphics card is set up when the next photo is made.";
"The import reads the catalog without changing it and adds its photos, edits, keywords and collections to the library open now." = "La importación lee el catálogo sin modificarlo y añade sus fotos, ediciones, palabras clave y colecciones a la biblioteca abierta ahora.";
"The library is up to date with this folder." = "La biblioteca está al día con esta carpeta.";
